// Extra Nextflow config that nf-test applies to every test (nf-test's default
// configFile, tests/nextflow.config). Tests pick their settings with profiles
// (e.g. test,pixi).
//
// Cap every task to what a GitHub-hosted runner has (ubuntu-latest: 4 CPUs,
// 16 GB). Module tests run without the `test` profile, so without this cap
// RELOCATE3_TE_SEARCH (label process_high: 8 CPUs) is refused on CI with
// "Task requirement exceeds available CPUs -- req: 8; avail: 4".
process {
    resourceLimits = [cpus: 2, memory: 6.GB, time: 1.h]
}
